<title>UK: Millennium &amp; Copthorne says trading in line.</title>
<headline>Millennium &amp; Copthorne says trading in line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kwek Leng Beng, chairman of four star business hotel group Millennium &amp; Copthorne which reported maiden results on Monday said current trading was in line with the company's forecasts.</p>
</text>
